    "description_html": "<p>A push-button ballpen made from sustainable bamboo with black trim and a chrome clip. An eco-friendly alternative to plastic promotional pens. It's part of our <a href=\"../../../../pens/bamboo-pens/\">custom bamboo pen range</a> at Custom Genie.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Made from sustainable bamboo with black trim and a chrome clip</li>\n<li>Eco-friendly alternative to plastic pens</li>\n<li>Large area for 'burned' effect laser engraving</li>\n<li>Prefer printed? See our printed version</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Engraving area: 60 x 6mm (printed version also available)<br />Writing ink color: Black</p>\n<p>Engraved bamboo pens are often referred to as engraved wooden pens, but bamboo is actually a type of grass. They do look and feel like wooden pens, so it's easy to see why they are often confused!</p>\n<p><strong>Please Note:</strong> As these pens are laser engraved rather than printed, your logo or design appears in 1-color 'burned' dark brown and multiple colors are not available. When you design this pen on our website your text and logos will be converted to 1-color dark brown even if you upload logos or text in different colors. If you prefer to have colored printing on your bamboo pens, please see our <a href=\"../../../../pens/bamboo-ballpoint-pens-printed/\">Printed Bamboo Pens</a>.</p>\n<p>No setup fees. No design fees!</p>"
  },
